# FORCED arms, 01_sand_entrance_dark (layer 2): every CParasite state body (statecall 0/1/2), trigger
# (trigcall) and script message (send) on the Crystallites, the machine walked through each state
# (fsm), light/dark resisted hits on the shell, then kills; Deactivate (deletes the actor) runs last.
# Run: BUILD=build-port-cov tools/cov/run.sh tools/cov/specs/parasite.py <out> 42b935e4,01_sand_entrance_dark --con <this> --fast --frames 1600
@f300 god 1; give missile 50; give darkBeam 1; give lightBeam 1; give darkAmmo 100; give lightAmmo 100
@f302 layer 2
@f310 objs parasite
@f330 place u052d player 5; place u04fc player 8
@f400 statecall u052d Generate 0; statecall u052d Generate 1; statecall u052d Generate 1 0.5; statecall u052d Generate 2
@f406 statecall u052d PathFind 0; statecall u052d PathFind 1; statecall u052d PathFind 1 0.5; statecall u052d PathFind 2
@f412 statecall u052d TargetPatrol 0; statecall u052d TargetPatrol 1; statecall u052d TargetPatrol 1 0.5; statecall u052d TargetPatrol 2
@f418 statecall u052d Patrol 0; statecall u052d Patrol 1; statecall u052d Patrol 1 0.5; statecall u052d Patrol 2
@f424 statecall u052d Run 0; statecall u052d Run 1; statecall u052d Run 1 0.5; statecall u052d Run 2
@f430 statecall u052d Attack 0; statecall u052d Attack 1; statecall u052d Attack 1 0.5; statecall u052d Attack 2
