@f460 statecall u052d Halt 0; statecall u052d Halt 1; statecall u052d Halt 1 0.5; statecall u052d Halt 2
@f466 statecall u052d Crouch 0; statecall u052d Crouch 1; statecall u052d Crouch 1 0.5; statecall u052d Crouch 2
@f472 statecall u052d GetUp 0; statecall u052d GetUp 1; statecall u052d GetUp 1 0.5; statecall u052d GetUp 2
@f478 trigcall u052d Stuck; trigcall u052d AttackOver; trigcall u052d ShotAt; trigcall u052d PatrolPathOver; trigcall u052d AnimOver; trigcall u052d Landed; trigcall u052d HitSomething; trigcall u052d ShouldAttack; trigcall u052d ShouldAttack 1; trigcall u052d HitSomething 1
@f484 send u052d Activate; send u052d Deactivate; send u052d ResistedDamage; send u052d ReflectedDamage; send u052d Launching; send u052d AreaLoaded; send u052d AIUpdateDisabled
